Algorithms re-implemented from the literature (no code copied):
  - Hasinoff et al., "Burst photography for high dynamic range and low-light
    imaging on mobile cameras", ACM TOG 35(6), 2016 (HDR+ align and merge).
  - Malvar, He, Cutler, "High-quality linear interpolation for demosaicing of
    Bayer-patterned color images", ICASSP 2004.
  - Mertens, Kautz, Van Reeth, "Exposure fusion", Pacific Graphics 2007.
  - He, Sun, Tang, "Guided image filtering", ECCV 2010 / TPAMI 2013.
  - Kim et al., "Design of advanced color temperature control system for HDTV
    applications" (Planckian locus approximation).
  - Valdes et al. triangle-invariant star matching (as popularised by astroalign).
  - Midtone transfer function auto-stretch as described for PixInsight STF.

Adobe DNG is a format specification by Adobe; Lumen writes DNG 1.4 files.
